sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant RateLimiter
    participant Semaphore
    participant Operation

    Client->>RateLimiter: execute(operation)
    RateLimiter->>RateLimiter: increment queue length
    RateLimiter->>Semaphore: acquire()
    Note over Semaphore: Suspends if at capacity
    Semaphore-->>RateLimiter: permit granted
    RateLimiter->>RateLimiter: increment active count
    RateLimiter->>Operation: invoke operation
    Operation-->>RateLimiter: result
    RateLimiter->>RateLimiter: decrement active/queue
    RateLimiter->>Semaphore: release()
    RateLimiter-->>Client: result
